    "article_summary": "This article describes the use of lead-halide perovskite nanocrystals (APbBr3) as cost-effective and efficient photocatalysts for C-C bond formation. Specifically, the authors demonstrate the alpha-alkylation of aldehydes, sp3-C couplings, and alkyl-halide reductions under visible light with high turnover numbers (TON > 52,000), outperforming traditional noble-metal catalysts like Ru and Ir complexes.",
